# ============================================================================
# Credentials - NEVER commit any of these.
#
# ops/freellmapi.config.json holds the dashboard admin password and the live
# provider API keys. ops/secrets/ holds the ENCRYPTION_KEY (which also encrypts
# database backups) and a copy of that password.
#
# These live here, on disk, ACL-restricted to one user account. They are
# supplied to Render through its secret prompt, never through Git.
# ============================================================================
ops/freellmapi.config.json
ops/secrets/

# ============================================================================
# The upstream FreeLLMAPI checkout (~448 MB, of which 361 MB is node_modules).
#
# It is a clone of a public project and has its own .git directory, so there is
# nothing of ours to publish in it. It also contains .env (the encryption key)
# and server/data/freeapi.db (the live database, including the unified API key).
# ============================================================================
freellmapi/

# ============================================================================
# Databases and backups
# ============================================================================
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.backup

# ============================================================================
# Environment files, wherever they appear
# ============================================================================
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# ============================================================================
# Local scratch output
# ============================================================================
*.out
*.err
*.log
